    喉 | hóu | throat; larynx | Has mouth radical 口 on the left instead of 犭
    猿 | yuán | ape; anthropoid | Has 袁 on the right instead of 侯
    猩 | xīng | gorilla; chimpanzee | Has 星 on the right instead of 侯
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
