    喉 | hóu | throat; windpipe
    侯 | hóu | marquis; target
    候 | hòu | wait; time; inquire
    篌 | hóu | musical ancient harp (箜篌)

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 猴子 specifically designates a monkey (having a tail), distinct from tail-less apes.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 猴子 vs. 猿 | yuán | 猴子 denotes monkeys (cercopithecines with tails), whereas 猿 denotes anthropoid apes without tails (gibbons, chimpanzees, orangutans).
    2 | 猴子 vs. 猩猩 | xīngxing | 猴子 is generic for smaller agile monkeys, while 猩猩 refers specifically to large great apes (chimpanzees, gorillas).
    3 | 猴子 vs. 狒狒 | fèifei | 猴子 live largely arboreal lives, while 狒狒 (baboons) are ground-dwelling primates with canine-like muzzles.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 穿行在幽深的热带雨林，密林树冠间时常传来欢快的喧闹声。几只机灵的金丝猴在繁茂的枝桠间敏捷腾跃，宛如林间的金色精灵。它们彼此梳理毛发，分享成熟的野果，在苍翠的大自然中自由自在地繁衍生息。 | Chuānxíng zài yōushēn de rèdài yǔlín, mìlín shùguān jiān shícháng chuánlái huānkuài de xuānnào shēng. Jǐ zhī jīling de jīnsīhóu zài fánmào de zhīyā jiān mǐnjié téngyuè, wǎnrú línjiān de jīnsè jīnglíng. Tāmen bǐcǐ shūlǐ máofà, fēnxiǎng chéngshú de yěguǒ, zài cāngcuì de dàzìrán zhōng zìyóu-zìzài de fányǎn-shēngxī. | Trekking deep rainforests, joyous clamor echoes among canopies. Golden snub-nosed monkeys leap between branches like sprites. Grooming fur and sharing wild fruit, they thrive freely in emerald nature. | Cruzando la selva tropical, un bullicio jovial vibra entre las copas. Varios monos dorados saltan ágiles como duendecillos de la floresta; espulgándose y compartiendo frutos, prosperan en libre comunión con la espesura.
  #2 | 在灵长类动物认知科学实验中，猴子展现出了令人惊叹的工具使用能力与初步的抽象推理技巧。研究灵长类动物的行为模式与群体社交结构，对于深入揭示人类大脑早期进化轨迹具有重大的基础理论价值。 | Zài língzhǎnglèi dòngwù rènzhī kēxué shíyàn zhōng, hóuzi zhǎnxiàn chū le lìngrén jīngtàn de gōngjù shǐyòng nénglì yǔ chūbù de chōuxiàng tuīlǐ jìqiǎo. Yánjiū língzhǎnglèi dòngwù de xíngwéi móshì yǔ qúntǐ shèjiāo jiégòu, duìyú shēnrù jiēshì rénlèi dànǎo zǎoqī jìnhuà guǐjì jùyǒu zhòngdà de jīchǔ lǐlùn jiàzhí. | In primate cognitive trials, monkeys demonstrate startling tool use and abstract deduction. Investigating primate behavior and group social dynamics holds fundamental theoretical value for deciphering early brain evolution. | En los ensayos cognitivos, los simios asombran por su manejo de útiles y deducción abstracta. Estudiar sus hábitos y tramas gregarias arroja luz sobre las sendas evolutivas del cerebro humano.
